OL,8,     Froad, the driver of a two-tonne
OL,9,     Fpickup rams an interceptor's car
OL,10,     Fbefore the rest of the team pitch
OL,11,     Fin to help out.
OL,12,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,13,     FIn Newton Abbot, undercover
OL,14,     Fdetective Nush spots a suspicious
OL,15,     Fcharacter in the crowds. She tails
OL,16,     Fthe suspect into a card shop but
OL,17,     Fthere's a problem - the suspect
OL,18,     Fhas disappeared.
