OL,5,G0100 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, Jane is fed up with
OL,7,     Fa painful rash on her scalp;
OL,8,     FMyfanwy has concerns that her mum
OL,9,     Fmay have sepsis after a procedure;
OL,10,     Fand Jean discusses her mental
OL,11,     Fhealth struggles.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FIt's a busy night at Barnsley
OL,14,     FHopsital's casualty department, so
OL,15,     Fwhen Sister Benita arrives to head
OL,16,     Fthe shift, the corridors are
OL,17,     Falready packed full of patients.
